Yoane Wissa scored two goals on Saturday night in Atlanta as Democratic Republic of Congo staged a second half rally to beat Uzbekistan 3-1 and advance to the knockout stages at the World Cup for the first time.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c97f91ee-729e-11f1-873f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/wiiss.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c97f91ee-729e-11f1-873f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/wiiss.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">25f6aa62-729e-11f1-a970-71c6c1951f4c</guid><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 03:41:23 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c97f91ee-729e-11f1-873f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/wiiss.jpg">AP Photo/Erik S. Lesser - Erik S. Lesser</source><dc:creator>Paul Myers</dc:creator></item><item><category>Sports</category><title>Croatia outmuscle Ghana to take second place in Group L as England beat Panama</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/sports/20260628-croatia-outmuscle-ghana-to-take-second-place-in-group-l-as-england-beat-panama-world-cup-2026</link><description>
Croatia saw off Ghana 2-1 on Saturday night at the Philadelphia Stadium to claim the runners-up spot in Group L behind England who overcame Panama 2-0 in New Jersey.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7e455208-729a-11f1-9eab-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/susic.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7e455208-729a-11f1-9eab-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/susic.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">aa5e3862-7288-11f1-ab8c-979b41aa7e93</guid><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 02:43:14 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7e455208-729a-11f1-9eab-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/susic.jpg">REUTERS - Pilar Olivares</source><dc:creator>Paul Myers</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>UK to introduce new legal routes for asylum seekers, refugees</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260627-uk-to-introduce-new-legal-routes-for-asylum-seekers-refugees</link><description>
The UK interior ministry has announced it will create new legal routes for asylum seekers, including allowing community organisations to sponsor refugees based on a similar system in Canada.  
