</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b2e6679a-7191-11f1-93d9-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/facebook-rtb-annonce-rutpure-relations-diplomatiques-avec-la-france.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b2e6679a-7191-11f1-93d9-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/facebook-rtb-annonce-rutpure-relations-diplomatiques-avec-la-france.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">8992fe3c-71fd-11f1-8f9a-7337819a1f80</guid><pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 07:59:41 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b2e6679a-7191-11f1-93d9-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/facebook-rtb-annonce-rutpure-relations-diplomatiques-avec-la-france.jpg">© RTB (screen grab)</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Lebanon, Israel and US sign trilateral framework pact</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260626-lebanon-israel-and-us-sign-trilateral-framework-pact</link><description>
Lebanon, Israel and the United States on Friday signed a trilateral framework agreement aimed at paving the way for a peace deal between the two long-time Middle East adversaries.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1c9577be-718b-11f1-9e57-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/cd28488ede66119c11a363905d9da6756f451321.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1c9577be-718b-11f1-9e57-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/cd28488ede66119c11a363905d9da6756f451321.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">1d66f87a-718b-11f1-8429-33b33717f8fa</guid><pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 18:16:12 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1c9577be-718b-11f1-9e57-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/cd28488ede66119c11a363905d9da6756f451321.jpg">© SAUL LOEB / AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International report</category><title>Turkey opposition worries that Europe is sacrificing democracy for security</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/podcasts/special-features/20260627-turkey-opposition-chp-says-europe-is-sacrificing-democracy-for-security</link><description>
